{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114347","id":3131262260,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc66o0U0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114347","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114347.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114347.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114347","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114347/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114347/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114347/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/256217b0ced00088f84f52fadf6fa61d00e86e2f","number":114347,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Document Android joypad vibration being unsupported","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/73446\r\n\r\nApparently, controller vibration on Android is very finicky. After some Google searches, some people say it works over Bluetooth, some people say it only works on wired controllers, someone says [vibration over wired connection only works for Xbox controllers](https://www.reddit.com/r/MoonlightStreaming/comments/1kajh45/comment/mpn6uhn/?utm_source=share&utm_medium=web3x&utm_name=web3xcss&utm_term=1&utm_content=share_button) and apparently, it's [not supported in Unity either](https://discussions.unity.com/t/inputsystem-controller-vibration-through-android/842815), so I think it should be mentioned in the docs that Godot doesn't support joypad vibration on Android.\r\nI/We can try to make it work only for wired controllers (if Android does allow it), but I'm not entirely sure if it's worth it since (I believe) most of the time controllers on Android are connected wirelessly via Bluetooth.\r\nTODO:\r\n- [ ] `has_joy_vibration()`","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-26T14:05:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T15:29:52Z","closed_at":"2026-05-06T15:28:48Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fa821fe906845854a418d4dccea8e5c84fd89802","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Nintorch:android-joypad-vibration-docs","